      "category": "lore",
      "title": "Chihebere's \"promised lands\" — a field guide",
      "excerpt": "Why CHE declared war on half of Central Qiyah in a single afternoon.",
      "body": "On February 28th 2019, the Federal Republic Of Chihebere declared war against NDR, RTN, BDA, SRZ, KPDR, and KZD.\n\nOfficial CHE rhetoric calls them the \"promised lands\" — rare-earth belts Chihebere controlled before the independence wave of the 80s–90s. Economic ruin after the partition left CHE desperate enough to gamble on a continental war.\n\nAllied pilots know the shorthand: if the brief mentions rare earths, expect long-range strike and someone yelling about Enzelafanzi.",
      "art": "media/news/central_qiyah.png"
